msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, I did not believe it was real. ⟪k:1⟫I thought it was a hallucination born of my "
"inner desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A princípio, não acreditei que fosse real. ⟪k:1⟫Eu pensei que era uma alucinação nascida de "
"meus desejos interiores."

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
